                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c7cf5fdf-e846-3b68-ab49-1fd08874a5df",
                        "entry_id": "453b70a8-bb58-35b5-a698-72d570939fae",
                        "glosses": [
                            "rust na hard en geconcentreerd werken"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2188f4e3-cf15-46ca-86ac-fa8151053773",
                                "sense_id": "c7cf5fdf-e846-3b68-ab49-1fd08874a5df",
                                "text": "Hij nam vorig jaar de beslissing Pauw en Jinek ieder evenveel zendtijd te geven. ,,Ook als blijk van vertrouwen in haar. Dat heeft zich dubbel en dwars uitbetaald. Eva is een unieke persoonlijkheid. Een echte journalist die toch ook een vleugje entertainment en verstrooiing weet te brengen.’’"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "79338155-66bd-4131-a6ad-8e46dab823da",
                                "sense_id": "c7cf5fdf-e846-3b68-ab49-1fd08874a5df",
                                "text": "Gerrit Jan Dwars dacht 100 jaar geleden dat er in zijn dorp behoefte was aan verstrooiing. \"Hij is verderop aan de Goorsestraatstraat een café begonnen."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2d7a7f1d-bc3c-391b-98e8-b09819ac1ae0",
                        "entry_id": "453b70a8-bb58-35b5-a698-72d570939fae",
                        "glosses": [
                            "verspreiding over een groter gebied dan oorspronkelijk het geval was"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0fd5598c-98a8-4f3e-8827-ab89fb10152a",
                                "sense_id": "2d7a7f1d-bc3c-391b-98e8-b09819ac1ae0",
                                "text": "Dat de lucht rood kleurt, heeft te maken met de afstand die de zonnestralen moeten afleggen door de atmosfeer en daarbij de mate van 'verstrooiing'. Blauw licht heeft de kortste golflengte; dat is ook waarom de lucht normaal gesproken blauw is. Maar door stofdeeltjes kan licht 'verstrooid'raken. Het blauwe licht wordt door kleine deeltjes - bijvoorbeeld waterstof - weerkaatst, waardoor relatief meer rood licht ons bereikt. Vandaar dat de hemel dan rood kleurt."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8e597ed6-4e1f-42c7-a467-9d0090145834",
                        "source_entry_id": "453b70a8-bb58-35b5-a698-72d570939fae",
                        "source_sense_id": "c7cf5fdf-e846-3b68-ab49-1fd08874a5df",
                        "source_sense_description": "amusement",
                        "target_lang_word": "Zerstreuung",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Zerstreuung",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "69710a21-0b4b-3fce-9bd1-9207c8524c02",
                                        "entry_id": "bad6eb53-728d-37dc-ade7-f9e98c4b5689",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Handlung, Gegenstände räumlich zu verteilen, und Ergebnis dieser Handlung"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8e27a58e-b8d9-3ffa-9d66-cdad78f72f22",
                                        "entry_id": "bad6eb53-728d-37dc-ade7-f9e98c4b5689",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Handlung, sich seelisch abzulenken/zu entlasten"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3322623b-11b4-4220-bd5e-4f5a4173ec86",
                                                "sense_id": "8e27a58e-b8d9-3ffa-9d66-cdad78f72f22",
                                                "text": "„Anders als in Viersen entschied die Stadt Hildesheim, den nicht an die Front abkommandierten Bürgern wieder mehr Möglichkeiten der Zerstreuung zu bieten.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40ad9df6-51a7-4367-99f0-5233707e2f4e",
                                                "sense_id": "8e27a58e-b8d9-3ffa-9d66-cdad78f72f22",
                                                "text": "„Weil es im Hotel kein deutsches Fernsehprogramm gab zwecks Zerstreuung, kamen alle an der Dartscheibe zusammen, Männer und Frauen, Trainer und Betreuer, Jüngere und Ältere.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "361ecd6f-e7da-4c19-a58c-43c8545046f0",
                                                "sense_id": "8e27a58e-b8d9-3ffa-9d66-cdad78f72f22",
                                                "text": "„Dabei hätte ihm ein bisschen Zerstreuung sicherlich gutgetan.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c3917bed-ae38-4551-b030-ed90b8f22ced",
                                                "sense_id": "8e27a58e-b8d9-3ffa-9d66-cdad78f72f22",
                                                "text": "„Es war furchtbar und unerträglich, beständig unter dem Druck dieser unlösbaren Lebensfragen zu stehen, und so überliess er sich den ersten besten Zerstreuungen, nur um diese Lebensfragen zu vergessen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a48afee5-b3c8-4da7-bbfa-a1f7561b5554",
                        "source_entry_id": "453b70a8-bb58-35b5-a698-72d570939fae",
                        "source_sense_id": "c7cf5fdf-e846-3b68-ab49-1fd08874a5df",
                        "source_sense_description": "amusement",
                        "target_lang_word": "amusement",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "amusement",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "321fcd87-27d7-37e2-a6a7-d5520cb3e57a",
                                        "entry_id": "e1bca45e-7d33-3ee3-b6f5-743a380f7c24",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Entertainment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "247c70fa-286d-4bef-bebb-e0e7702ea5d2",
                                                "sense_id": "321fcd87-27d7-37e2-a6a7-d5520cb3e57a",
                                                "text": "To my great amusement, the dog kept on chasing its tail and yelped when it bit it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0e737311-22aa-422b-bf9b-65a918b4bb94",
                                                "sense_id": "321fcd87-27d7-37e2-a6a7-d5520cb3e57a",
                                                "text": "This is some form of amusement you're talking about."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e4f97894-f873-3dfd-8037-c185990084d8",
                                        "entry_id": "e1bca45e-7d33-3ee3-b6f5-743a380f7c24",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An activity that is entertaining or amusing, such as dancing, gunning, or fishing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e5d70d6-fdd6-425e-afd2-45ab4bad3bd4",
                                                "sense_id": "e4f97894-f873-3dfd-8037-c185990084d8",
                                                "text": "\"What a charming amusement for young people this is, Mr. Darcy! There is nothing like dancing after all. I consider it as one of the first refinements of polished society.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0bdd7367-bdd2-498d-9848-56ca96262f11",
                                                "sense_id": "e4f97894-f873-3dfd-8037-c185990084d8",
                                                "text": "His chief amusements were gunning and fishing, or sauntering along the beach and through the myrtles, in quest of shells or entomological specimens--his collection of the latter might have been envied by a Swammerdamm."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7013f761-b22d-467a-bb84-05d69a48f281",
                                                "sense_id": "e4f97894-f873-3dfd-8037-c185990084d8",
                                                "text": "The Cat was sour-tempered and grumpy, at first, but before they had journeyed far, the crystal creature had discovered a fine amusement. The long tails of the monkeys were constantly sticking through the bars of their cage, and when they did, the Glass Cat would slyly seize the tails in her paws and pull them."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
